reached its conclusion.


00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:57.552
You got eyes on Sarge...?


00:01:57.585 --> 00:01:58.753
I see you Jimmy.


00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:01.321
Tell the kid to put the
gun down right now!


00:02:01.856 --> 00:02:04.391
Put the gun down on
the ground now, slowly, now


00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:05.760
It's my fathers gun.


00:02:06.761 --> 00:02:07.829
What is he saying?


00:02:07.862 --> 00:02:09.463
It's his fathers gun, he
doesn't want to put it down.


00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:10.330
He has to put it down or


00:02:10.364 --> 00:02:11.298
someone's going
to get hurt. Tell him!


00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:11.966
I have to honor
my father's memory,


00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:12.867
I cannot leave his gun here.


00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.869
Lower the gun now
or they will shoot.


00:02:14.902 --> 00:02:16.236
I must take it home with me.


00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:17.672
Tell the kid to put
the gun down now!


00:02:17.705 --> 00:02:18.740
I have to honor
my fathers memory,


00:02:18.773 --> 00:02:19.741
he died here, I cannot
put his gun on the ground.


00:02:19.774 --> 00:02:20.340
Put it down now, they're
going to shoot you.


00:02:20.374 --> 00:02:21.274
What's happening Sarge!


00:02:21.308 --> 00:02:23.210
Lost in translation,
hold your positions!


00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.312
Hold your fire!


00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:26.614
Under your command


00:02:26.648 --> 00:02:29.316
innocent civilian
lives were lost.


00:02:29.684 --> 00:02:32.920
United States military
has a zero-tolerance policy


00:02:32.954 --> 00:02:36.490
pertaining to the
unsanctioned collateral damage


00:02:36.524 --> 00:02:38.392
of civilians on the battlefield.


00:02:39.794 --> 00:02:42.797
Therefore you and the
members of your unit


00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:45.232
are hereby found guilty


00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:47.401
of all the charges
brought against you.


00:02:48.736 --> 00:02:51.438
You'll be discharged
from your post


00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:54.909
and stripped of all rank and
benefits associated with it.


00:02:54.942 --> 00:02:56.176
What the fuck did you do?


00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:57.111
He had a weapon and they were
hiding right behind that dune...


00:02:57.145 --> 00:03:00.748
I take no pleasure
in reading this verdict,


00:03:01.716 --> 00:03:05.953
but you should be thankful that
your actions have not damaged


00:03:05.987 --> 00:03:09.389
our trust and nation building
efforts in the Middle East.


00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:11.391
They were gonna kill me.


00:03:11.425 --> 00:03:13.761
We'll bury him here and
no one will fucking know.


00:03:14.662 --> 00:03:15.830
He's just a kid.


00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.733
He's a fucking kid,
Jesus fucking Christ.


00:03:18.766 --> 00:03:19.834
Sarge... Sarge.


00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:23.370
Congressman Ambrose, do
you have a closing statement?


00:03:24.605 --> 00:03:25.807
Yes I do, thank you your honor.


00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:31.979
As a ranking member of the
House Armed Services Committee,


00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:33.948
I have many
thoughts on this case,


00:03:33.981 --> 00:03:35.415
but only one thing to say...


00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:41.488
I'm calling it in. Base.


00:03:41.522 --> 00:03:43.891
Go for base. Come
in... go for base..


00:03:43.925 --> 00:03:45.760
- Sgt. Barnes...
- What's your call sign?


00:03:45.793 --> 00:03:46.928
Thank you for your service


00:03:46.961 --> 00:03:48.196
