00:04:19.861 --> 00:04:20.995
We'd be wise not to appeal.


00:04:21.028 --> 00:04:22.196
Says who?


00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.866
Uncle Sam. I mean, you still
have dental through the VA.


00:04:25.967 --> 00:04:27.735
