Well, good thing
I said it for you.


00:05:05.173 --> 00:05:06.974
Hey, let's take a walk.


00:05:07.008 --> 00:05:08.676
There's too many
ears around here.


00:05:08.709 --> 00:05:10.578
Yeah, I can use a fucking walk.


00:05:11.411 --> 00:05:13.848
I think we can both agree
that you got fucked in there.


00:05:13.881 --> 00:05:15.516
- Mm hmm.
- Off the record, of course.


00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:17.618
Look...


00:05:17.652 --> 00:05:20.054
look you're not the first
to be sacrificed to save face...


00:05:20.387 --> 00:05:22.489
Right now there's not
much I can do about that.


00:05:23.157 --> 00:05:25.660
But I will help you in any
way I can, I give you my word.


00:05:25.693 --> 00:05:26.794
Yeah, I've heard that before.


00:05:26.828 --> 00:05:27.829
Not from me you haven't.


00:05:28.696 --> 00:05:31.666
And I wouldn't appeal
if I were you, all right.


00:05:32.867 --> 00:05:34.535
Let sleeping dogs lie.


00:05:34.569 --> 00:05:36.671
You're not going to further
your cause in that court.


00:05:36.938 --> 00:05:38.139
Yeah.


00:05:38.172 --> 00:05:40.808
Slogans from
politicians, it's unique.


00:05:41.876 --> 00:05:42.944
I'll level with you.


00:05:43.878 --> 00:05:45.478
My uncle served in Nam,


00:05:45.513 --> 00:05:46.781
