00:08:23.337 --> 00:08:24.872
Sounds good.


00:08:40.721 --> 00:08:43.891
Office of Congressman Dakota
Ambrose, how may I help you?


00:08:43.924 --> 00:08:44.825
Reginald Barnes,


00:08:44.859 --> 00:08:46.927
