00:11:32.326 --> 00:11:34.261
and thank you guys
all so much for that,


00:11:34.295 --> 00:11:35.729
and thank you so much
for letting me share.


00:11:35.763 --> 00:11:37.131
- Thank you Dani.
- Thank you Dani.


00:11:37.698 --> 00:11:41.135
Anyone else, anyone...


