00:11:58.587 --> 00:12:01.889
Yeah, just had a bunch
of stuff come up recently.


00:12:01.922 --> 00:12:02.856
Oh.


00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:06.060
Anniversary of a friend
who didn't make it.


00:12:06.093 --> 00:12:07.461
You know, brings up a...


00:12:08.796 --> 00:12:09.763
a lot of shit.


00:12:09.797 --> 00:12:12.366
Yeah, I know. I mean,
I know what you mean.


00:12:13.434 --> 00:12:14.735
- Yeah.
- Sucks.


00:12:18.973 --> 00:12:20.774
I wrote my number down for you.


00:12:21.208 --> 00:12:22.943
If you ever wanted
to give me a call,


00:12:23.578 --> 00:12:24.979
