- Can I get you something?


00:13:35.282 --> 00:13:36.250
Cup of coffee?


00:13:36.283 --> 00:13:37.284
Black, right?


00:13:38.452 --> 00:13:41.021
Ann, can I get two cups of
black coffee in here, please.


00:13:43.357 --> 00:13:45.225
