been able to get


00:14:16.591 --> 00:14:18.992
is a minimum wage
warehouse position.


00:14:22.062 --> 00:14:23.063
What's this about?


00:14:26.033 --> 00:14:27.201
It's an opportunity.


00:14:29.303 --> 00:14:30.471
Take a look at that,


00:14:31.238 --> 00:14:32.373
