01:41:21.649 --> 01:41:22.717
Vitamin C.


01:41:22.750 --> 01:41:24.117
Mm Hmm.


01:41:50.678 --> 01:41:51.779
Dakota...


01:41:52.747 --> 01:41:54.314
I did some thinking.


01:41:55.148 --> 01:41:57.752
I'm more comfortable with
twenty percent on our deal.


01:41:58.586 --> 01:42:00.153
She's waiting for you.


01:42:06.326 --> 01:42:08.161
No hard feelings huh?


01:42:36.858 --> 01:42:39.794
This is the first building
I ever purchased.


01:42:41.261 --> 01:42:42.195
When I found it


01:42:42.229 --> 01:42:44.331
I knew the property
value was in the gutter,


01:42:44.364 --> 01:42:46.834
but even then I could tell
it was worth something.


01:42:47.602 --> 01:42:51.673
You see gentlemen, I have a
knack for recognizing value.


01:42:51.706 --> 01:42:52.840
You for instance.


01:42:53.340 --> 01:42:57.244
When I found you toiling as a
clerk in the halls of Congress,


01:42:57.277 --> 01:42:58.713
you were useless,


01:42:58.746 --> 01:43:03.283
And now you're a powerful
Congressman, future Governor.


01:43:03.316 --> 01:43:06.486
In that way you remind
me of my late husband.


01:43:06.521 --> 01:43:09.256
And like him you
have a weakness,


01:43:09.657 --> 01:43:11.291
which brings us to you.


01:43:11.893 --> 01:43:13.761
The recovering drunk,


01:43:13.795 --> 01:43:16.329
a liability you should've
paid more attention to.


01:43:16.363 --> 01:43:17.632
But you did serve your purpose.


01:43:18.298 --> 01:43:22.335
Because of you, I have
a rather shocking video


01:43:22.369 --> 01:43:24.639
...of an American
politician's brother


01:43:24.672 --> 01:43:27.374
directly involved in
the ruthless murder


01:43:27.407 --> 01:43:29.476
...of a helpless man.


01:43:30.111 --> 01:43:33.981
Ordered and sanctioned
by so said politician.


01:43:36.517 --> 01:43:37.785
Your "AA Buddy"


01:43:38.653 --> 01:43:41.622
...my niece "Dani",


01:43:41.656 --> 01:43:44.826
happens to be very
handy with a smart phone.


01:43:46.293 --> 01:43:47.628
Now,


01:43:47.662 --> 01:43:49.329
Mr. Ambrose.


01:43:49.864 --> 01:43:52.934
Can you guess
what's in my pocket?


01:43:54.569 --> 01:43:55.536
No.


01:43:55.570 --> 01:43:56.771
You are.


01:43:57.772 --> 01:43:58.940
As you climb the ladder,


01:43:58.973 --> 01:44:02.375
you'll come to realize that
the rent is paid in favors.


01:44:03.310 --> 01:44:06.047
And now, most importantly,
you, Sergeant Barnes,


01:44:06.080 --> 01:44:07.280
a true hero.


01:44:07.314 --> 01:44:10.718
I think I speak for myself and
the future Governor Ambrose


01:44:10.752 --> 01:44:13.755
when I thank you
for clearing our name.


01:44:13.788 --> 01:44:16.389
The politician wouldn't have
a future if it wasn't for you.


01:44:16.423 --> 01:44:18.559
I'd say we're indebted,


01:44:18.593 --> 01:44:20.995
but I think Ambrose
already knows that.


01:44:21.929 --> 01:44:26.701
Now, if you all want to stay out
of prison and above ground, then


01:44:27.702 --> 01:44:29.436
I'm your only option.


01:44:30.337 --> 01:44:31.606
The way I see it...


01:44:32.339 --> 01:44:35.777
you'll be doing my
bidding from here on out.


01:44:37.779 --> 01:44:38.913
Gentlemen.


01:44:56.664 --> 01:44:57.665
Can we talk?


01:44:58.199 --> 01:45:01.068
I feel like there's a lot to
talk about after that, right?


01:45:01.102 --> 01:45:02.703
Congressional
recess is over, Seth.


01:45:02.737 --> 01:45:04.437
I got to get back
to the Capitol.


01:45:05.006 --> 01:45:07.708
Hey, I'll reach out soon,


01:45:08.609 --> 01:45:09.944
stay out of trouble.


01:45:12.980 --> 01:45:14.649
Trouble won't find me.


01:45:15.516 --> 01:45:16.651
I know that's right.


01:45:27.427 --> 01:45:28.428
Hey Barnes.


01:45:29.163 --> 01:45:30.330
Yeah.


01:45:30.832 --> 01:45:31.933
You free tomorrow?


01:45:33.901 --> 01:45:35.002
Of course.


01:45:35.468 --> 01:45:37.505
Why don't you come
down to DC with me.


01:45:38.072 --> 01:45:39.907
We got a lot of work to do.


01:45:40.875 --> 01:45:42.442
DC it is.

